item.description:
&lt;p&gt;Rising alarm about AI’s perils is thrusting into the spotlight a collection of little-known research groups focused on the technology’s safety&amp;mdash;and fueling questions about their ability to effectively monitor the industry’s biggest companies.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;
[4기준 점수] impact=4.6 freshness=3.3 depth=3.0 buzz=1.5
출처: theinformation (US)

&lt;p&gt;Tech bosses have called for a slowdown in artificial intelligence and formal guardrails to be introduced by the US government. But President Trump is not moved by the doomsday predictions, calling them a ‘hoax'. What is behind his affection for the AI industry?&amp;nbsp;
[4기준 점수] impact=1.6 freshness=3.0 depth=3.0 buzz=1.5
출처: guardian_tech (EU)

&lt;p&gt;A team of cybersecurity researchers with startup Hacktron AI used Anthropic’s Claude to hack into OpenAI, gaining access to a key repository of OpenAI’s software, &lt;a href="https://www.hacktron.ai/blog/hacking-openai"&gt;the researchers revealed Thursday&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;
[4기준 점수] impact=5.0 freshness=1.6 depth=3.0 buzz=1.5
출처: theinformation (US)
